{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"a92095c554f3cda477b63c33b522bd765a0d2f9f359b56bd09fc3a0fe927aa7a","digest":{"component_or_area":"review-bot logging configuration","key_entities":["src/rebar/review_bot/app.py","src/rebar/review_bot/voter","_emit()","voter_voted","voter_skip","merge_detection","reconcile_*","REVIEW_BOT_LOG_LEVEL","logging.getLogger(\"rebar\")","StreamHandler","tests/unit/test_review_bot.py"],"problem_keywords":["logging","structured logs","observability","info events","stdout","journald","silent drop","handler configuration"],"propositions":["rebar.review_bot.* INFO _emit() records are silently dropped in production because no logging handler is configured for the rebar logger; records fall through to lastResort which only emits WARNING and above","uvicorn only configures its own uvicorn.* loggers at startup, leaving rebar and root logger unconfigured, causing INFO observability markers to be invisible to operators","A _configure_logging() function must be added to src/rebar/review_bot/app.py, called at module import, that attaches a StreamHandler to the rebar logger at INFO level with idempotency to prevent duplicate handlers on reload","The logging configuration must respect a REVIEW_BOT_LOG_LEVEL environment variable for level override, default to INFO when absent or invalid, and set propagate=False to avoid duplicate output through uvicorn","After configuration, logging.getLogger(\"rebar.review_bot.*\").info(...) records must reach stdout with bare %(message)s formatting to preserve already-JSON _emit payloads"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785823973409336967,"uuid":"9fdaed42-13a6-43d6-8e36-a56b28294ef1"}